WEBVTT

00:00:00.680 --> 00:00:03.560
I'm gonna be the first-star idol one day!

00:00:03.560 --> 00:00:07.440
Nijino Yume's about to start her Aikatsu!{no}

00:00:08.820 --> 00:00:11.780
Now that you've all made it into your respective classes,

00:00:11.780 --> 00:00:17.200
we've decided to give all you first-years a taste of what it's like on Aikatsu TV!

00:00:18.950 --> 00:00:21.580
We're gonna be on Aikatsu TV?

00:00:21.580 --> 00:00:22.790
No way!

00:00:22.790 --> 00:00:24.080
Awesome!

00:00:24.080 --> 00:00:26.960
All the hard work to get into Song Class was worth it! {Sumire's VA, by the way}

00:00:26.960 --> 00:00:27.590
Sure was!

00:00:27.590 --> 00:00:31.590
Your upperclassmen Shiratori and Kasumi are counting on you!{it needed some kind of rewording to make it not sound like she was talking to two people named Shiratori and Kasumi}

00:00:31.590 --> 00:00:33.090
Get on it! {ehhhhh}

00:00:33.090 --> 00:00:34.590
Okay!

00:00:35.260 --> 00:00:41.100
It took no time at all for us to get to hear Hime-senpai sing up close!

00:00:42.270 --> 00:00:44.890
Yume-chan, you've got great taste!

00:00:44.890 --> 00:00:48.690
I know! How would you like to form a unit with me?

00:00:48.690 --> 00:00:50.780
M-Me and you together?!

00:00:50.780 --> 00:00:54.110
Let me think, what should we call it...

00:00:54.110 --> 00:00:56.950
How does Princess Dream sound?

00:00:58.160 --> 00:01:02.790
G-Great! It's perfect!

00:01:04.370 --> 00:01:06.120
What's with that dumb smile on your face?

00:01:06.540 --> 00:01:08.750
Y-You're seeing things.

00:01:08.750 --> 00:01:13.880
I was just a bit anxious about appearing on Aikatsu TV.

00:01:13.880 --> 00:01:15.050
Rola?

00:01:15.050 --> 00:01:20.560
That gets me going. Let's show the world what we're really made of. {I have reason to believe this will be laura's catchphrase. I'd hoped they'd go easy on us}

00:01:20.560 --> 00:01:22.930
Yeah, you're right!

00:01:22.930 --> 00:01:25.060
I gonna give it my all!

00:03:04.410 --> 00:03:06.790
The taste of Aikatsu TV she was talking about...

00:03:06.790 --> 00:03:09.120
...turned out to be backstage work.

00:03:09.710 --> 00:03:11.250
It's almost the rehearsal, step on it!

00:03:11.250 --> 00:03:12.250
Yes, right away!

00:03:14.670 --> 00:03:16.130
I was naïve.

00:03:16.130 --> 00:03:20.840
It gets me going. Backstage work is educational in its own way. {fuck it}

00:03:20.840 --> 00:03:22.680
I guess so.

00:03:22.680 --> 00:03:24.390
It's Hime-senpai!

00:03:25.390 --> 00:03:26.970
She's lovely!

00:03:27.890 --> 00:03:30.140
The rehearsal must be starting soon!

00:03:30.140 --> 00:03:31.640
I want to see her too!

00:03:32.770 --> 00:03:35.020
Hime-senpai!

00:03:36.650 --> 00:03:38.400
What do you think you're doing?

00:03:38.690 --> 00:03:40.650
Are you downgrading yourselves to fans?

00:03:40.950 --> 00:03:43.240
Get back and do your work.

00:03:44.070 --> 00:03:45.910
Saw that coming.

00:03:47.030 --> 00:03:50.120
Still, a little won't hurt.

00:03:50.120 --> 00:03:51.540
He's going to get angry.

00:03:51.540 --> 00:03:52.620
Rola.

00:03:52.620 --> 00:03:54.130
Hey, look.

00:04:00.010 --> 00:04:01.380
I wonder what's happening.

00:04:01.920 --> 00:04:05.010
It seems like it's something serious.

00:04:05.010 --> 00:04:07.180
Huh? They're leaving.

00:04:07.180 --> 00:04:08.510
What about the rehearsal?

00:04:09.140 --> 00:04:09.930
Hey!

00:04:09.930 --> 00:04:12.810
S-Sorry! We didn't mean to spy...

00:04:12.810 --> 00:04:14.690
Call the others.

00:04:17.610 --> 00:04:19.780
We're going to rebuild the entire stage.

00:04:20.530 --> 00:04:23.200
No whining. Just do as I say.

00:04:23.200 --> 00:04:25.870
There's no time! I need you all.

00:04:25.870 --> 00:04:27.700
Okay...

00:04:27.700 --> 00:04:30.870
We were almost finished though.

00:04:30.870 --> 00:04:32.710
Why...

00:04:33.660 --> 00:04:35.710
Sounds tough on your end.

00:04:35.710 --> 00:04:40.550
Forget about learning from Hime-senpai's singing, I just wanted a break from all that heavy lifting.

00:04:40.550 --> 00:04:42.550
I'm pooped.

00:04:43.090 --> 00:04:44.720
How are things on your side?

00:04:44.720 --> 00:04:50.140
Good. Yozora-senpai is working hard to prepare for the fashion show the day after tomorrow.

00:04:50.140 --> 00:04:52.730
I got to help her with the fitting today.

00:04:52.730 --> 00:04:55.480
Wow, how lucky.

00:04:55.480 --> 00:04:56.480
Want to see?

00:04:56.480 --> 00:04:57.980
I do, I do!

00:05:00.730 --> 00:05:02.490
They're all gorgeous.

00:05:02.490 --> 00:05:04.610
No less from a top model!

00:05:04.610 --> 00:05:08.620
I heard her dress for the show in two days will be even more exquisite.

00:05:08.620 --> 00:05:11.540
What show in two days?

00:05:11.540 --> 00:05:13.620
You're unbelievable.

00:05:13.910 --> 00:05:17.170
What do you think we've been busting our butts for?

00:05:17.170 --> 00:05:21.880
S4 Presents: A Premium Night is airing in two days.

00:05:21.880 --> 00:05:23.630
Did you forget?

00:05:26.130 --> 00:05:29.140
N-No, it just slipped my mind!

00:05:31.010 --> 00:05:33.890
Sorry, I was exhausted.

00:05:33.890 --> 00:05:35.350
What a girl.

00:05:35.350 --> 00:05:37.400
In any case, it's so exciting.

00:05:37.400 --> 00:05:42.020
We'll be able to see Yozora-senpai and Hime-senpai's Premium Rare Dresses. {whoa, she said Yozora first}{I think stars is a good time to fix our capitalization issues (e.g. School Dress)}

00:05:42.020 --> 00:05:43.190
Yeah...

00:05:43.190 --> 00:05:44.990
Are you really that tired?

00:05:44.990 --> 00:05:47.860
No, I can handle this much.

00:05:47.860 --> 00:05:51.780
All right, I'd better eat up to prep for tomorrow!

00:05:53.830 --> 00:05:55.410
It's yummy!

00:05:55.410 --> 00:05:56.790
You'll get fat.

00:06:00.040 --> 00:06:01.790
So tired...

00:06:04.050 --> 00:06:09.720
I'm sure it was tough, but Yozora-senpai and Hime-senpai had even more on their plates.

00:06:09.720 --> 00:06:10.930
You think?

00:06:10.930 --> 00:06:12.050
Yeah.

00:06:12.350 --> 00:06:16.430
Yozora-senpai had three interviews as well as a lesson today.

00:06:16.810 --> 00:06:22.190
And tomorrow she'll even be doing a photoshoot as the cover girl for Aikatsu Style Girls.

00:06:22.900 --> 00:06:24.440
Seriously?

00:06:27.610 --> 00:06:30.660
The nights are still a bit chilly this time of year.

00:06:31.450 --> 00:06:32.910
I'm closing the window.

00:06:32.910 --> 00:06:34.240
Oh, go ahead.

00:06:39.210 --> 00:06:40.620
What is it?

00:06:40.620 --> 00:06:43.540
Well, someone's playing piano. {what even is that thing in the background? mirror cover? Akari had one too}{I think it's a bunk bed, ichigo had one as well}

00:06:43.540 --> 00:06:45.210
At this hour?

00:06:49.510 --> 00:06:51.090
I must've been hearing things.

00:06:51.090 --> 00:06:52.720
Oh.

00:06:55.640 --> 00:06:59.230
But anyway, I hope I get to see Hime-senpai tomorrow!

00:06:59.690 --> 00:07:01.730
Don't worry, I'm sure you will.

00:07:01.730 --> 00:07:05.440
Yeah, it'll be the day before the fashion show.

00:07:07.990 --> 00:07:09.740
Well, that was wishful thinking.

00:07:09.740 --> 00:07:13.450
I get the feeling I won't see her all day.

00:07:14.240 --> 00:07:15.990
Slide over, I'll help out.

00:07:15.990 --> 00:07:18.750
Rola! Thanks.

00:07:19.120 --> 00:07:21.670
It feels like we're a lot busier than yesterday.

00:07:21.670 --> 00:07:25.000
Well, of course. We need to totally redo the stage we built.

00:07:25.000 --> 00:07:29.130
Gather around! We just got some refreshments, so everyone take a breather.

00:07:29.130 --> 00:07:30.590
Refreshments!

00:07:37.560 --> 00:07:40.980
These bagel sandwiches are delicious! I wonder where they got them.

00:07:40.980 --> 00:07:42.770
They look handmade to me.

00:07:42.770 --> 00:07:44.690
Really? That's cool.

00:07:44.690 --> 00:07:46.940
So did you really need to double-fist those?

00:07:46.940 --> 00:07:49.150
He said we could have them!

00:07:49.490 --> 00:07:50.900
Hey, jumbo ribbon.

00:07:50.900 --> 00:07:52.950
Huh? You mean me?

00:07:52.950 --> 00:07:55.910
Oh no! Is it really one per person?

00:07:55.910 --> 00:07:57.370
No, it's two.

00:07:57.370 --> 00:07:58.620
Yay!

00:07:58.620 --> 00:07:59.410
Come here.

00:08:00.040 --> 00:08:01.910
Take these over to storage.

00:08:02.540 --> 00:08:04.250
Saw that coming.

00:08:08.170 --> 00:08:11.470
Is this all I'll be doing one day before the show?

00:08:15.680 --> 00:08:16.680
Great!

00:08:16.680 --> 00:08:20.180
Let's try some different poses now.

00:08:20.180 --> 00:08:21.230
Okay.

00:08:23.480 --> 00:08:25.190
Ooh, I like that one.

00:08:25.440 --> 00:08:26.940
Very nice, Yozora-chan.

00:08:30.570 --> 00:08:32.070
To the next set.

00:08:32.070 --> 00:08:33.700
Could you make adjustments?

00:08:36.320 --> 00:08:37.530
Thank you.

00:08:37.530 --> 00:08:39.330
Y-You're welcome.

00:08:40.040 --> 00:08:41.410
Koharu-chan!

00:08:41.410 --> 00:08:43.040
Ready to keep going?

00:08:43.580 --> 00:08:47.590
Yeah, you're working it. Keep it up, Yozora-chan!

00:08:47.590 --> 00:08:51.630
This must be the Aikatsu Style Girls photoshoot she mentioned.

00:08:51.630 --> 00:08:55.840
Seriously, she's nailing every single pose with so much precision.

00:08:55.840 --> 00:09:00.100
Not to mention how much balance she must have to hold so steady.

00:09:00.470 --> 00:09:04.020
That's right, how are things going for tomorrow's fashion show?

00:09:04.020 --> 00:09:05.850
You're co-starring with Hime-chan, right?

00:09:05.850 --> 00:09:09.360
Yes, Hime and I are well into our preparations. {no shit they're preparing the day before}

00:09:10.520 --> 00:09:14.610
All the more to look forward to. 
I'll be shooting from the front row.

00:09:14.610 --> 00:09:17.620
Thank you, I'll keep an eye out.

00:09:17.910 --> 00:09:20.240
You're so lucky, Koharu-chan.

00:09:20.240 --> 00:09:23.080
At least you get to help Yozora-senpai personally.

00:09:23.620 --> 00:09:26.460
Why did I even join the Song Class...

00:09:27.250 --> 00:09:30.210
Everyone, tomorrow's the big day.

00:09:30.750 --> 00:09:34.510
Be sure to arrive two hours before we go live.

00:09:34.510 --> 00:09:35.510
Okay!

00:09:35.510 --> 00:09:39.180
Another day gone by without seeing Hime-senpai.

00:09:39.180 --> 00:09:40.010
Hey.

00:09:40.010 --> 00:09:42.520
Are you listening to me, jumbo ribbon?

00:09:42.520 --> 00:09:44.270
Y-Yes!

00:09:44.270 --> 00:09:47.140
You look like you're itching for more work.

00:09:47.140 --> 00:09:51.270
Very well. I have a very important job for you.

00:09:51.270 --> 00:09:56.110
Huh? Wh-What important job?

00:10:06.580 --> 00:10:09.380
Wh-What important job?

00:10:09.380 --> 00:10:14.090
Come in at six AM tomorrow and check that all the props are in order.

00:10:14.090 --> 00:10:16.630
You're our only hope, jumbo ribbon.

00:10:18.630 --> 00:10:20.260
That's it for today!

00:10:22.350 --> 00:10:24.310
You're kidding me...

00:10:24.310 --> 00:10:25.100
Here.

00:10:26.230 --> 00:10:30.560
Isn't this a good thing? This job is a chance for you to show them what you're made of.

00:10:30.560 --> 00:10:31.900
Thanks.

00:10:32.190 --> 00:10:35.150
That's a handmade smoothie packed full of vegetables.

00:10:35.150 --> 00:10:37.150
It's today's refreshment.

00:10:41.410 --> 00:10:42.530
Sounds bitter.

00:10:42.530 --> 00:10:46.750
That's a good thing! It's got great nutritional value.

00:10:49.370 --> 00:10:50.790
It's delicious!

00:10:56.340 --> 00:10:58.300
Wow, this is great!

00:11:02.300 --> 00:11:05.890
Okay! Working hard bright and early!

00:11:13.360 --> 00:11:15.150
Wait, isn't this...

00:11:20.320 --> 00:11:22.570
But it's so early.

00:11:26.740 --> 00:11:28.700
My, hello there.

00:11:28.700 --> 00:11:30.370
Little early bird.

00:11:31.710 --> 00:11:33.830
H-Hime-senpai!

00:11:33.830 --> 00:11:36.710
G-Go-Good morning!{I don't know what to think of your stuttering technique}

00:11:39.800 --> 00:11:40.840
Good morning!

00:11:42.130 --> 00:11:46.220
You certainly got an early start today. There must be a lot on your plate.

00:11:46.220 --> 00:11:48.470
Yes! I-I mean...

00:11:48.470 --> 00:11:51.350
We'll be sure to finish rebuilding the stage in—

00:11:52.770 --> 00:11:56.020
It appears I've given you all a heavy burden.

00:11:56.020 --> 00:11:57.480
N-Not at all...

00:11:59.530 --> 00:12:01.490
Say, Yume-chan.

00:12:01.490 --> 00:12:04.370
Have you ever seen the inside of a piano?

00:12:04.370 --> 00:12:05.620
I haven't.

00:12:05.620 --> 00:12:07.790
Would you mind lending me a hand?

00:12:07.790 --> 00:12:09.620
S-Sure.

00:12:12.710 --> 00:12:17.590
If the countless strings and hammers aren't each working at one hundred percent,

00:12:17.590 --> 00:12:19.710
a proper melody can't be played.

00:12:19.710 --> 00:12:21.880
I-I suppose so.

00:12:21.880 --> 00:12:22.930
Do you understand?

00:12:22.930 --> 00:12:24.010
What?

00:12:24.010 --> 00:12:25.800
Please don't forget.

00:12:26.850 --> 00:12:30.680
This is one of the keys to a successful performance. {this is a-ok with me}

00:12:33.690 --> 00:12:36.110
In any case, how are you on time?

00:12:38.110 --> 00:12:39.530
Oh no!

00:12:39.530 --> 00:12:41.530
I-I need to get going now!

00:12:48.780 --> 00:12:54.790
<i>I see. The piano Koharu-chan heard must've been Hime-senpai!</i>

00:12:56.790 --> 00:12:58.630
Good morning!

00:13:06.180 --> 00:13:09.680
Wow, they've progressed so much since yesterday.

00:13:10.390 --> 00:13:12.810
I've gotta do my fair share too!

00:13:16.900 --> 00:13:19.980
Half an hour until we go live. Everyone ready?

00:13:19.980 --> 00:13:21.070
Yes!

00:13:21.070 --> 00:13:23.190
Everything is in order.

00:13:23.690 --> 00:13:24.740
Good.

00:13:24.740 --> 00:13:26.700
Kasumi Yozora-san is on the set.

00:13:31.160 --> 00:13:32.370
Koharu-chan!

00:13:34.460 --> 00:13:38.210
I got to be Yozora-senpai's assistant for the day.

00:13:38.210 --> 00:13:39.670
That's awesome!

00:13:39.670 --> 00:13:40.960
Nice job.

00:13:40.960 --> 00:13:45.380
All I did was win a rock-paper-scissors contest though.

00:13:45.380 --> 00:13:47.970
I'll be relying on you today.

00:13:49.340 --> 00:13:51.850
Next up, Shiratori Hime-san is also on the set.

00:13:52.810 --> 00:13:55.480
Good morning, ladies.

00:13:56.690 --> 00:14:01.230
I apologize for increasing your workload by requesting a set change.

00:14:01.610 --> 00:14:05.030
But your efforts have made it exactly as I imagined.

00:14:05.030 --> 00:14:07.070
You have my sincerest gratitude.

00:14:07.070 --> 00:14:08.240
It's our pleasure.

00:14:08.240 --> 00:14:10.240
It was no trouble at all.

00:14:10.240 --> 00:14:12.240
Good luck, Hime-chan.

00:14:12.240 --> 00:14:15.910
Thank you. And you as well, girls.

00:14:15.910 --> 00:14:19.500
Thank you for all of your help.

00:14:19.500 --> 00:14:21.880
I'll be learning from your example.

00:14:21.880 --> 00:14:23.750
Th-Thank you too.

00:14:24.840 --> 00:14:26.130
Nervous again, I see.

00:14:28.130 --> 00:14:31.890
Kasumi-san, Shiratori-san, please come this way.

00:14:31.890 --> 00:14:33.930
I'll see you after.

00:14:41.940 --> 00:14:44.730
The fusion of a splendid fashion show and live concert.

00:14:44.730 --> 00:14:48.650
It's time for S4 Presents: A Premium Night.

00:14:49.070 --> 00:14:53.160
I, Miwa Tamagorou, shall be your host.

00:14:55.160 --> 00:14:58.000
Isn't he the Beauty Class teacher?

00:14:58.000 --> 00:14:59.830
I guess he can do anything.

00:15:01.290 --> 00:15:04.170
Let us call in today's guests.

00:15:04.420 --> 00:15:09.170
Kasumi Yozora-san, Shiratori Hime-san, come on down!{let it be known that I still detest this lack of and}

00:15:25.070 --> 00:15:28.570
Good evening, everyone. I'm Kasumi Yozora.

00:15:28.570 --> 00:15:32.320
I'm Shiratori Hime. I welcome you all.

00:15:36.490 --> 00:15:38.500
<i>They're shining like stars!</i>

00:15:38.500 --> 00:15:41.000
<i>The fans seem to love them too.</i>

00:15:43.330 --> 00:15:44.210
What do you think?

00:15:45.880 --> 00:15:47.630
It's all amazing!

00:15:47.630 --> 00:15:51.090
That's what you get from S4, 
the top idols of Four Star Academy.

00:15:51.090 --> 00:15:52.760
That's definitely part of it,

00:15:53.840 --> 00:15:57.850
but everyone here is working to bring out Yozora-senpai and Hime-senpai's appeal

00:15:57.850 --> 00:16:00.600
so that a hundred percent of it—no, even more—

00:16:00.600 --> 00:16:02.900
can shine through.

00:16:02.900 --> 00:16:04.350
One hundred percent, huh.

00:16:05.360 --> 00:16:08.820
It's those two who are drawing it out of us.

00:16:08.820 --> 00:16:15.620
Those girls are putting in more than one hundred percent despite their harsh schedules.

00:16:16.950 --> 00:16:19.870
We're just responding in kind.

00:16:19.870 --> 00:16:23.960
They even make sure to provide us backstage folks with nice refreshments.

00:16:25.040 --> 00:16:27.420
Then are you saying our refreshments...

00:16:27.420 --> 00:16:28.630
were made by...

00:16:31.260 --> 00:16:35.300
The bagel sandwiches were from Hime-chan, and the smoothies from Yozora-chan.

00:16:35.300 --> 00:16:36.930
I had no idea.

00:16:38.140 --> 00:16:41.180
<i>Hime-senpai and Yozora-senpai were even busier than us...</i>

00:16:42.560 --> 00:16:44.900
<i>Wait, I think I get it now!</i>

00:16:50.110 --> 00:16:55.410
It's time to present the 
Premium Dress I'll be wearing tonight. {you forgot the D}

00:16:55.410 --> 00:17:00.120
Like the boundless, starry desert skies of One Thousand and One Nights.

00:17:00.120 --> 00:17:02.620
My coord is built on the theme of Arabian jewels.

00:17:03.410 --> 00:17:05.870
The Arabian Sparkle Coord!

00:17:07.790 --> 00:17:09.250
Lovely.

00:17:09.250 --> 00:17:14.880
The Arabian Sparkle Coord has a coquetry befitting the Romance Kiss brand.

00:17:14.880 --> 00:17:17.680
One glance puts you in an Oriental mood.

00:17:18.300 --> 00:17:20.640
Now I'll present my coord.

00:17:25.600 --> 00:17:31.400
It's filled with my wishes of being able to spend our time together like princes and princesses.

00:17:31.940 --> 00:17:34.360
The Dreaming Princess Coord.

00:17:37.240 --> 00:17:39.160
This one has its own charms.

00:17:39.160 --> 00:17:46.960
The Dreaming Princess Coord exudes a sweet and cute aura perfect for the My Little Heart brand.

00:17:50.130 --> 00:17:52.300
Who wants to see them now?

00:17:52.300 --> 00:17:54.210
We do!{added}

00:17:55.920 --> 00:17:57.970
An impatient bunch, you are.

00:17:57.970 --> 00:18:02.060
Now then, let's raise the curtain on their stage!

00:21:13.000 --> 00:21:17.330
Look forward to the next installment of A Premium Night!

00:21:17.330 --> 00:21:19.290
So this is S4...{D_S}

00:21:19.290 --> 00:21:23.590
<i>Hime-senpai, I think I understand now.</i>

00:21:24.090 --> 00:21:29.100
<i>Many different people put forth one hundred percent doing many different things.</i>

00:21:29.970 --> 00:21:34.020
<i>All to bring a single performance together!</i>

00:21:42.320 --> 00:21:43.490
That's it for tonight.

00:21:44.030 --> 00:21:47.240
That was a job well done, Song Class first-years.{I mean, it's fine in general, but I think we're married to this now}

00:21:47.240 --> 00:21:48.240
Thank you!

00:21:48.240 --> 00:21:51.660
It was only a few short days, 
but thank you for the experience.

00:21:51.660 --> 00:21:55.500
I'll be relying on you when its me atop that stage.

00:21:55.500 --> 00:21:58.000
Oh? You sure know how to talk the talk.

00:21:58.000 --> 00:22:01.380
M-Me too! Thank you.

00:22:01.380 --> 00:22:05.380
Jumbo ribbon, I think your name was Nijino Ume or something?

00:22:05.380 --> 00:22:06.880
It's Yume.

00:22:06.880 --> 00:22:08.640
I can see it in you.

00:22:10.300 --> 00:22:13.640
Even if your idol dream falls apart, 
a bright future in backstage work awaits.

00:22:13.970 --> 00:22:15.520
Don't you agree, girls?

00:22:18.650 --> 00:22:21.520
Don't say that!

00:23:58.950 --> 00:24:01.410
We held A Premium Night!

00:24:01.410 --> 00:24:04.790
There, we announced our brands' seasonal themes.

00:24:04.790 --> 00:24:08.170
Our themed Premium Dresses were quite gorgeous.

00:24:08.170 --> 00:24:10.130
Wasn't it exhilarating?

00:24:10.720 --> 00:24:13.220
Rola, we've got a test coming up.{am I incredibly deaf or does this sound like フェスト (I mean I know it would be フェス but it does not sound like テスト)}

00:24:13.220 --> 00:24:16.140
Sounds interesting. It's gonna be on Dress Make.{let's treat this as a noun (and a proper one), as in "we're going to use Dress Make tomorrow"}

00:24:16.140 --> 00:24:18.720
But I've never done it before!

00:24:18.720 --> 00:24:20.770
Next time on Aikatsu Stars!

00:24:20.770 --> 00:24:22.190
My Dress Make!

00:24:22.190 --> 00:24:24.480
Become the first-star idol!
